==Spanish==

===Pronunciation===
* {{es-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|i|lang=es}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|la|es}} ''[[sic|sīc]]'', probably through a compound {{m|la|ad}} {{m|la|sīc}}. Cognates include {{m|es|sí||yes}}. Compare Portuguese ''[[assim]]'', Catalan ''[[així]]'', French ''[[ainsi]]'', Italian ''[[così]]'', Romanian ''[[așa]]''.

====Adverb====
{{es-adv}}

# like this; like that; as such; [[thus]]; [[so]]
# {{lb|es|followed by a subjunctive clause}} {{n-g|Used to express wishes of misfortune against someone, or to cast a spell}}
#: {{ux|es|¡'''Así''' reciba un dolor de cabeza!|'''I hope''' he gets a headache! ''or'' '''May''' he get a headache!}}

